@startuml state-payroll
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #1C2230
  FontColor #1C2230
  ArrowColor #1C2230
}

title Payroll.status state machine (spec §7)

[*] --> DRAFT : generatePayroll(yearMonth) (UC-09, FR-15, BR-11)

state DRAFT {
  DRAFT : minWageWarning must be acknowledged\nbefore Confirm is enabled (FR-16, BR-09)
  DRAFT --> DRAFT : re-generate month\n[replaces DRAFT rows only] / generatePayroll (UC-09)
}

DRAFT --> CONFIRMED : owner confirms\n[warning acknowledged if present] / confirmPayroll (UC-09, FR-15)

CONFIRMED --> [*]

note right of CONFIRMED : final state — read-only,\nnot replaced by re-generation
@enduml
